  "estimatedMinutes": null,
  "statement": "Which is greater, \\(\\log _{2008}(2009)\\) or \\(\\log _{2009}(2010)\\) ?",
  "answerChoices": [],
  "answer": {
    "letter": null,
    "value": null
  },
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-guts-2009-p8.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Let \\(f(x)=\\log _{x}(x+1)\\). Then \\(f^{\\prime}(x)=\\frac{x \\ln x-(x+1) \\ln (x+1)}{x(x+1) \\ln ^{2} x}<0\\) for any \\(x>1\\), so \\(f\\) is decreasing. Thus \\(\\log _{2008}(2009)\\) is greater.",
